# The hook scripts are executed on Windows and macOS from the same checkout.
# This repo is configured with core.autocrlf=true, so without this rule a Windows
# checkout would rewrite these files with CRLF. That is harmless while they are
# invoked as `node "<path>"`, but it silently breaks the `#!/usr/bin/env node`
# shebang the moment anyone runs one directly. Pin them to LF so both platforms
# get byte-identical files.
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
